  "request": "A 90-second heavy metal fusion in Bhairav, Sa = E, teentaal at 128 bpm. Build it as a song around one main riff: a grinding half-step power-chord shuffle between Sa and komal Re that keeps coming back, heavier each time. Open with a short sitar alap over the drone, bring the band in on the riff, and give the sitar a memorable hook that returns with the riff. Drop into a breakdown, then build to a climax where the sitar plays a fast taan while the band keeps driving underneath. End with a hard stop: the sitar on upper Sa over one low Sa power chord.",
